---
---
<footer class="bg-[#1F1A17] text-[#FAF6F0] pt-16 pb-8 mt-20 border-t border-[#3A312B] relative overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Subtle background glow -->
  <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/4 w-96 h-96 bg-emerald/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="absolute bottom-0 right-1/4 w-96 h-96 bg-terracotta/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 grid md:grid-cols-12 gap-10 relative z-10">
    <!-- Brand / Logo presentation -->
    <div class="md:col-span-5 space-y-4">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-[#55463C] bg-white/10 p-1 shadow-sm">
          <img 
            src="/images/logo-watercolor.jpg" 
            alt="Elqui Joyas Logo Oficial Acuarela" 
            class="w-full h-full object-cover rounded-xl"
          />
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-white tracking-wide">Elqui Joyas</p>
          <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#C78883]">Nicolás Cordero · Orfebre</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm text-[#D5C6BA] leading-relaxed max-w-sm">
        Joyería y orfebrería de autor forjada a mano en el Valle de Elqui. Metales nobles, cristales naturales e inspiración astronómica bajo los cielos del Cerro Mamalluca.
      </p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-[#A8988C] pt-2">
        <span>📍</span> Vicuña, Valle de Elqui, Región de Coquimbo, Chile.
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Quick Navigation -->
    <div class="md:col-span-3 space-y-3">
      <h4 class="text-xs uppercase font-semibold tracking-widest text-[#C5A059]">Navegación</h4>
      <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-sm text-[#D5C6BA]">
        <li>
          <a href="/#inicio" class="hover:text-[#F0E0B4] transition-colors flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-[#C78883]">✦</span> Inicio
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="/tienda" class="hover:text-[#F0E0B4] transition-colors flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-[#C78883]">✦</span> Tienda & Catálogo
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="/#acerca" class="hover:text-[#F0E0B4] transition-colors flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-[#C78883]">✦</span> Acerca de Nicolás
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="/#videos" class="hover:text-[#F0E0B4] transition-colors flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-[#C78883]">✦</span> Taller en Video (Reels)
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="/#valores" class="hover:text-[#F0E0B4] transition-colors flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-[#C78883]">✦</span> Origen & Mística
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="/#contacto" class="hover:text-[#F0E0B4] transition-colors flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-[#C78883]">✦</span> Contacto
          </a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Direct Channels & Admin -->
    <div class="md:col-span-4 space-y-4">
      <h4 class="text-xs uppercase font-semibold tracking-widest text-[#C5A059]">Contacto & Redes</h4>
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <a 
          href="https://wa.me/56931983075" 
          target="_blank" 
          rel="noopener noreferrer" 
          class="flex items-center gap-3 p-3 rounded-2xl bg-white/5 border border-[#3A312B] hover:border-[#C5A059] transition text-sm text-[#FAF6F0] group"
        >
          <span class="text-lg">💬</span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-medium group-hover:text-[#F0E0B4]">WhatsApp Directo</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-[#A8988C]">+56 9 3198 3075</p>
          </div>
        </a>

        <a 
          href="https://instagram.com/elqui_joyas" 
          target="_blank" 
          rel="noopener noreferrer" 
          class="flex items-center gap-3 p-3 rounded-2xl bg-white/5 border border-[#3A312B] hover:border-[#C78883] transition text-sm text-[#FAF6F0] group"
        >
          <span class="text-lg">📸</span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-medium group-hover:text-[#E8C5C2]">Instagram Oficial</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-[#A8988C]">@elqui_joyas</p>
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="pt-2">
        <a href="/admin" class="text-xs text-[#8A7B70] hover:text-[#C5A059] transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1">
          <span>🔒</span> Panel de Administración
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Sub-footer con créditos a MelodIA Lab -->
  <div class="mt-12 pt-6 border-t border-[#3A312B] relative z-10">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-[#A8988C]">
      <p>© 2024 Elqui Joyas · Joyería de Autor en el Valle de Elqui.</p>
      <p class="flex items-center gap-1.5 font-normal text-[#C4B5A5]">
        Hecho con el amor ❤️ y la energía ⚡ de 
        <a 
          href="https://www.melodialab.net" 
          target="_blank" 
          rel="noopener noreferrer" 
          class="text-[#FAF6F0] hover:text-[#C5A059] font-semibold underline underline-offset-4 decoration-[#C5A059]/60 hover:decoration-[#C5A059] transition-colors"
        >
          MelodIA Lab
        </a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
